{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31369","headline":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作 · 李邺","name":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长听巴西事，看图胜所闻。\n江楼明返照，雪岭乱晴云。\n景象诗情在，幽奇笔迹分。\n使君徒说好，不祗怨离羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}